{"id":"steam-1058030","steam":1058030,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Roskur's Run","summary":"Roskur's Run is an evolution of classic 90's \"Hedgehog\" physics-based platforming with a deeper move set, upgrades, and a non-linear world to explore. The loop: Explore > Collect > Upgrade > SPEED RUN > Unlock > Explore","about":"Miss those good ol' days of classic retro 90's gameplay, before BOOST and the death of momentum? Feel abandoned after Mania? \r\n\r\n\nRoskur Does What Sonican't.\n\r\n\r\nRoskur's Run is an evolution of classic 90's \"Hedgehog\" physics-based platforming with a deeper move set, upgrades, and a non-linear world to explore. Experience a casual introduction to speed running with a unique game structure where you must shave your best times down to unlock world progression.\r\nEnjoy perfect painstakingly painted pixel art in this fantasy adventure to delay Ragnarök. Climb the world tree to warn the eagle that sits atop it about Nidhogg's approaching reptilian horde. WILL YOU MAKE IT IN TIME?!?!\r\n\r\nOnly if you wishlist! Save Midgar you distinguished gamers with skill and taste!","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1058030/library_600x900.jpg?t=1748467474","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1058030/header.jpg?t=1748467474","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1058030/library_hero.jpg?t=1748467474","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1058030/header.jpg?t=1748467474","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1058030/ss_e5c1cf37ee367833554ebc9990ee0e3348658e61.600x338.jpg?t=1748467474","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1058030/ss_e5c1cf37ee367833554ebc9990ee0e3348658e61.jpg?t=1748467474"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1058030/s